<title>SINGAPORE: Datacraft 1st-half net profit up 75 pct.</title>
<headline>Datacraft 1st-half net profit up 75 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (millions of US dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				 4.64 vs    2.65</p>
<p>    Interim dividend (Singapore cts)   0.55 vs    0.50</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)			2.50 vs    1.50</p>
<p>    Group shr fully diluted (cents)    2.40 vs    1.40</p>
<p>    Turnover				  65.65 vs   37.11</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest	  0.09 vs    0.05</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		     0.31 vs    0.04</p>
<p>    Depreciation (expense)		 1.72 vs    0.91</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			   6.07 vs    3.41</p>
<p>    Tax					  1.42 vs    0.77</p>
<p>    Dividend pay date:    February 28, 1997</p>
<p>Last day books open:  February 12, 1997</p>
<p>Note - Datacraft Asia Ltd is a communications and network systems integrator.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
